{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Basil","id":"339235123759153162","is_bot":0,"username":"divinedefault"},"author_id":"339235123759153162","channel_id":"851507810730508359","content":"that's ok. this year it's just a unique resource that you can collect once a day with an investigation check(all boosts can apply, advantage, features, spells) but can also be found in event loot and from npc's. \n\nthen the essence will have a rarity and type, the rarity determines it's gold value and the type makes it easier to craft items of that type(essence of that type will be worth double it's rarity value)\n\nin the harvest checks and if left unspecified in loot you roll a d20 to determine the type. (and if the rarity is unspecified there's a 1d100 chart for that)\n\nthat's the basics and there's two other essence mechanics but we can file those under: optional.","created_at":"2021-07-23T23:32:59.048000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"868274527212277781","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
